{"parentUuid":"f816208e-8f24-4704-ac56-323674147a0b","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408","agentId":"a9d8ba25a087fb653","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VhBNBL4fYPL5tX8a9KPL9q","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"终末地 Endfield 武陵 电池 产线 布局 攻略\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"《明日方舟：终末地》四号谷地基建毕业攻略：三测日入400万布局分享\",\"url\":\"https://mumu.163.com/news/20251221/41823_1277720.html\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟终末地》四号谷地产线规划推荐 四号谷地产线怎么规划-游民星空 GamerSky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202601/2078943.shtml\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟：终末地》有哪些「少走弯路」的诀窍？ - 知乎\",\"url\":\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/1998832235890090399\"},{\"title\":\"明日方舟·终末地蓝图分享（持续更新中）\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamekee.com/zmd/691229.html\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield - 明日方舟终末地中文版下载及攻略资料\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/z/arknights-endfield/\"},{\"title\":\"【终末地】基建蓝图一键攻略！胶囊+装备原件+电池蓝图分享！幸运萝卜位置大全 《明日方舟：终末地》|魔法Zc目录_哔哩哔哩bilibili\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WVzWBuEoF/\"},{\"title\":\"明日方舟终末地攻略秘籍专题_明日方舟终末地攻略大全 | 图文视频攻略 _ 游民星空 Gamersky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/z/arknights-endfield/handbook/\"},{\"title\":\"【明日方舟:終末地】谷地、武陵開荒至畢業工廠藍圖一鍵貼上！各階段目標1次看清？不缺調度券！#ArknightsEndfield #EndfieldCreators #EndfieldReleaseCC - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QNnSRvxyeFY\"},{\"title\":\"【终末地】1.0武陵毕业基建 摆完挂机 简单好抄 息壤装备原件/低容武陵电池/息壤/芽针针剂_哔哩哔哩bilibili_明日方舟_游戏攻略\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1c7zYBtEfX/\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟终末地》武陵基建毕业蓝图-游民星空 GamerSky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202602/2086813.shtml\"}]\n\n根据搜索结果，我找到了关于《明日方舟：终末地》中武陵地区电池产线布局的相关信息：\n\n## 武陵电池产线布局要点\n\n武陵地区的毕业基建主要需要三个模块：两台满速天有洪炉、两台满速息壤电池、一条满速武陵药剂。\n\n### 电池产线配置\n\n内部已经集成了发电机，无需再外置发电设备，放置两台电池设备就满足武陵目前的供电所有需求。\n\n### 关键资源需求\n\n由于当前武陵的蓝铁矿点稀缺，目前武陵的蓝铁只有90的速率，而产线满速需要120，这就需要谷地输血蓝铁矿。\n\n### 蓝图分享\n\n搜索结果中还包含了多个蓝图分享码，例如核心武陵电池：EF018OIei6iI915aUI73、总线武陵电池1：EF0170i8o91iE559O2Ai、总线武陵电池2：EF0170i8o91iE585O2Ai等，玩家可以直接导入使用。\n\n如果需要更详细的布局设置或其他特定产线的攻略，可以参考游民星空、B站up主\"魔法Zc目录\"等平台的详细教程。\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"bdc42a6c-4fc6-4ef7-a3d5-af9e9a63f410","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:10:38.740Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f816208e-8f24-4704-ac56-323674147a0b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"c8643dcb-72a6-4e8d-b58e-63c87f55e275","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408","agentId":"a9d8ba25a087fb653","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C7xidvNFgwJo3ESRiSmcz1","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Arknights Endfield IndustrialPlanner blueprint design philosophy reddit\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Arknights Endfield Blueprints & Codes - Best Optimized AIC Layouts\",\"url\":\"https://mobalytics.gg/arknights-endfield/bases/blueprints\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield Blueprint Codes Guide\",\"url\":\"https://www.ldshop.gg/blog/arknights-endfield-gp/blueprint-codes.html\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield Blueprints and Codes｜Game8\",\"url\":\"https://game8.co/games/Arknights-Endfield/archives/534265\"},{\"title\":\"Factory (AIC) Community Blueprints - Arknights Endfield | EndfieldTools.DEV - EndfieldTools.DEV\",\"url\":\"https://endfieldtools.dev/community-factories/\"},{\"title\":\"Browse Endfield Blueprints | Talos Pioneers\",\"url\":\"https://talospioneers.com/en\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights Endfield Blueprint Hub - ArknightsEndfield.gg\",\"url\":\"https://arknightsendfield.gg/arknights-endfield-blueprint/\"},{\"title\":\"EnKAD - Arknights: Endfield Factory Planner\",\"url\":\"https://enkad.enka.network/\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights Endfield AIC Blueprint Guide: Create and Share | GAMES.GG\",\"url\":\"https://games.gg/arknights-endfield/guides/arknights-endfield-blueprint-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"Blueprint Editor - Arknights: Endfield Factory Planner\",\"url\":\"https://enka.network/endfield/aic/\"},{\"title\":\"The Best Mega Base Blueprint You Need for Arknights: Endfield\",\"url\":\"https://www.ldshop.gg/blog/arknights-endfield-gp/best-base-blueprint.html\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about Arknights Endfield blueprints and their design philosophy, though specific Reddit discussions weren't prominently featured. Here's what I found:\n\n## Blueprint Design Philosophy\n\nThe game's blueprint system lets you save your best factory layouts and share them with other players, creating a community-driven library of optimized designs. AIC Blueprints function as saved snapshots of your factory configurations, capturing the exact placement, connections, and settings of your production lines.\n\nThe most effective blueprint creators design modular systems, creating focused modules that handle specific production chains instead of massive factory-wide blueprints.\n\n## Key Design Principles\n\nFrom a practical standpoint, successful blueprint designs emphasize:\n\n- Long-term scalability that works now and improves as Regional Development levels increase, resource stability especially for critical bottlenecks, and low maintenance with fewer rebuilds\n\n- Modular approaches that provide easier troubleshooting with problems isolated to specific modules and flexible scaling to add or remove modules based on needs\n\n## Community Sharing\n\nThe Arknights Endfield subreddit serves as the primary hub for blueprint sharing, with players regularly posting their most efficient designs with detailed explanations.\n\nThe search results focus primarily on practical blueprint usage guides rather than in-depth Reddit discussions about design philosophy specifically.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"d7e3e3d3-38e5-4caa-aab1-4fea31509480","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:10:40.351Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c8643dcb-72a6-4e8d-b58e-63c87f55e275","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"09453c0b-85be-4c13-beb1-ebc4de5c0591","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408","agentId":"a9d8ba25a087fb653","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DTFXAXwM6NhNb4vUSBJoUs","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Arknights Endfield factory layout guide power pole conveyor\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Arknights Endfield Factory Guide - AIC Base Building & Automation | Arknights.win\",\"url\":\"https://www.arknights.win/endfield/guides/factory/\"},{\"title\":\"Factory (AIC) Community Blueprints - Arknights Endfield | EndfieldTools.DEV - EndfieldTools.DEV\",\"url\":\"https://endfieldtools.dev/community-factories/\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield Factory Layout & Production Guide - Maximize Stock Bills | Output Lag\",\"url\":\"https://outputlag.com/guides/arknights-endfield-factory-layout-production-guide-maximize-stock-bills/\"},{\"title\":\"How to Build Your First Base in Arknights: Endfield - Icy Veins\",\"url\":\"https://www.icy-veins.com/arknights-endfield/news/how-to-build-your-first-base-in-arknights-endfield/\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights Endfield Blueprints & Codes - Best Optimized AIC Layouts\",\"url\":\"https://mobalytics.gg/arknights-endfield/bases/blueprints\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights Endfield Base Building Guide | Arknights: Endfield\",\"url\":\"https://endfield.gg/arknights-endfield-base-building-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield - Factory Tutorial and Guide\",\"url\":\"https://enka.network/endfield/aic/tutorial\"},{\"title\":\"AIC Factory Guide: Master Base Building in Arknights Endfield | GAMES.GG\",\"url\":\"https://games.gg/arknights-endfield/guides/arknights-endfield-aic-factory-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"Factory Simulator for Arknights Endfield | EndfieldTools.DEV - EndfieldTools.DEV\",\"url\":\"https://endfieldtools.dev/factory-planner/planner/\"},{\"title\":\"Best AIC Factory Blueprints for Arknights: Endfield - Icy Veins\",\"url\":\"https://www.icy-veins.com/arknights-endfield/news/best-aic-factory-blueprints-for-arknights-endfield/\"}]\n\nI found several comprehensive guides about Arknights Endfield factory layout design, power systems, and conveyor belts. Here's what the search results reveal:\n\n## Power System (Power Pole/Relay Tower)\n\nPower originates from your PAC or any Sub-PAC you establish at outposts. Relay Towers extend this energy across the map, with each tower reaching up to 80 meters from a powered source. These towers don't power machines directly. They feed signal to Electric Pylons, which then distribute wireless power to all facilities within their radius.\n\nYou distribute power using Relay Towers, which connect to Electric Pylons that power everything nearby.\n\n## Conveyor Belt Layout\n\nConveyor belts connect your production facilities into automated lines. Resources flow from PAC outputs → through processing units → back to PAC inputs or storage. \n\nAllow belts to cross over each other without interference. Clean up messy layouts. As you unlock Logistics upgrades, you gain access to splitters (divide item flow), bridges (manage crossing paths), and convergers (merge multiple inputs).\n\n## Layout Design Tips\n\nPlan before building - Sketch your layout mentally before placing structures. Use Protocol Stashes - Position between Refining and Packaging units to eliminate wasted space. Rotate structures strategically - Allow backward output connections for tighter layouts.\n\nFor visual planning tools and community blueprints, browse public blueprints in-game, or check community sites like EndfieldTools.dev and Talos Pioneers for specialized setups.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"a96e1252-1075-4e9a-b6ee-727f21a68001","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:10:40.546Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"09453c0b-85be-4c13-beb1-ebc4de5c0591","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"4dc17088-af67-41f3-9f1e-04956ce723d1","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408","agentId":"a9d8ba25a087fb653","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SsM7nSvcgcX1KzPYVvJPeH","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"终末地 工厂 布局 端口 走向 老司机 技巧 b站\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"明日方舟·终末地基础教程_明日方舟·终末地wiki|GameKee\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamekee.com/zmd/691227.html\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟终末地》工业开荒规划与产线布局分享-游民星空 GamerSky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202601/2080424.shtml\"},{\"title\":\"【终末地】4月帝江号一图流基建排班表！摆完挂机享受高效收益！\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13dd5BqE2e/\"},{\"title\":\"P社要发行自己的幸福工厂？我来尝尝咸淡_游戏杂谈\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1sRoyBCE1A/\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟终末地》四号谷地各阶段基建蓝图码分享-游民星空 GamerSky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202601/2081167.shtml\"},{\"title\":\"明日方舟·终末地开荒指南_明日方舟·终末地wiki|GameKee\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamekee.com/zmd/692862.html\"},{\"title\":\"终末地 1.2 下半地图！试验园区提前打卡！_游戏热门视频\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ttoCBGENy/\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟终末地》四号谷地产线规划推荐 四号谷地产线怎么规划-游民星空 GamerSky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202601/2078943.shtml\"},{\"title\":\"【终末地】基建作业-集成援助活动第二期！完整版！一键毕业蓝图&摆完挂机！包含全阶段攻略！集成援助·掌中救星！\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wiR6BpEbP/\"},{\"title\":\"异星工厂 Factorio 周文韬的设计手册 规划 - 哔哩哔哩\",\"url\":\"http://www.bilibili.com/read/cv8139148\"}]\n\n我已为您搜索了这个查询。根据搜索结果，这似乎与游戏《明日方舟：终末地》有关。结果主要包含以下信息：\n\n## 主要内容\n\n游戏中的蓝图系统是专门为懒人设计的新模式，简单来说就是抄作业，把别人设计好的图纸直接全部一整块放在空地上。\n\n终末地不鼓励原材料总线-二级材料总线-成品这样的大工厂思路，应该遵照现地加工原则，总线尽可能输出原材料，在现场一路加工成成品。\n\n关于工厂布局和基建设计，工厂的产出主要目的是供应据点的需求，开荒阶段的规划是据点需求什么，就在相应的据点内拍下对应的蓝图。\n\nB站上有许多相关的基建教程视频和攻略分享，梦轩dada等内容创作者提供了包含前期/中期/后期的开荒和毕业蓝图，供玩家参考学习。\n\n如果您需要了解关于特定阶段或特定产线的更多详细信息，我可以进行更具体的搜索。\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"fb8327cb-1f13-4601-b9ad-112f22a889ca","timestamp