eeding into secondary material buses and finished products\n- **现地加工 (On-site processing)**: A design principle where buses output raw materials as much as possible, with all processing happening on-site into finished products\n- **设计哲学 (Design philosophy)**: The game's industrial design philosophy emphasizes limiting conveyor belt capacity while maximizing available space\n\nThe search results show many community-created blueprint resources, guides, and discussions from players sharing optimal factory designs for the game's base-building system. However, I did not find specific information about \"梦轩\" (Mengxuan) in the results - this may be a content creator or player name in the community that didn't appear in these particular search results.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"147e6b59-bf32-4c67-8eb7-1ebc95f32df4","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:10:53.736Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e62bc067-eb50-446a-94fe-b75bf8e96789","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"7dc9ebac-2cb7-4327-8296-9a02cd3f7774","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408","agentId":"a9d8ba25a087fb653","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GiFvG7qLasPFqq1FGi9WXy","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Endfield AIC factory blueprint power pole spacing storage box ratio\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Factory (AIC) Community Blueprints - Arknights Endfield | EndfieldTools.DEV - EndfieldTools.DEV\",\"url\":\"https://endfieldtools.dev/community-factories/\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights Endfield Blueprints & Codes - Best Optimized AIC Layouts\",\"url\":\"https://mobalytics.gg/arknights-endfield/bases/blueprints\"},{\"title\":\"EnKAD - Arknights: Endfield Factory Planner\",\"url\":\"https://enkad.enka.network/\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield Blueprints and Codes｜Game8\",\"url\":\"https://game8.co/games/Arknights-Endfield/archives/534265\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights Endfield AIC Factory Plan\",\"url\":\"https://arknightsendfield.gg/arknights-endfield-aic-factory-plan/\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights Endfield AIC Blueprint Guide: Create and Share | GAMES.GG\",\"url\":\"https://games.gg/arknights-endfield/guides/arknights-endfield-blueprint-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"Curated AIC Blueprints - Arknights: Endfield Factory Planner\",\"url\":\"https://enka.network/endfield/aic/blueprints\"},{\"title\":\"Best AIC Factory Blueprints for Arknights: Endfield - Icy Veins\",\"url\":\"https://www.icy-veins.com/arknights-endfield/news/best-aic-factory-blueprints-for-arknights-endfield/\"},{\"title\":\"Best 1.1 AIC Factory Blueprints for Arknights: Endfield - Icy Veins\",\"url\":\"https://www.icy-veins.com/arknights-endfield/news/best-1-1-aic-factory-blueprints-for-arknights-endfield/\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights Endfield Blueprint Codes - AIC Layouts & Guide\",\"url\":\"https://endfieldcalculator.org/blueprint\"}]\n\nI've completed a web search for \"Endfield AIC factory blueprint power pole spacing storage box ratio.\" The search results return information about Arknights: Endfield's AIC (Automated Industry Complex) blueprint system, which is used for creating and sharing factory layouts in the game.\n\nHowever, the search results don't contain specific technical specifications about power pole spacing or storage box ratios. The results focus on general blueprint guides, community blueprint sharing, and factory optimization strategies, but don't include the detailed technical specifications you're looking for.\n\nThe search results discuss:\n- Community Factory (AIC) blueprint codes for Arknights: Endfield, with optimized Wuling AIC and Valley-IV AIC layouts\n- How the AIC blueprint feature allows players to capture the exact arrangement of buildings, conveyor belts, and power lines, which can be deployed in any suitable location\n- General factory optimization and blueprint sharing communities\n\nIf you're looking for specific technical ratios and spacing requirements for power poles and storage boxes in Endfield blueprints, you may need to consult more specialized technical documentation, community forums like the Arknights: Endfield subreddit, or in-game guides that provide detailed building specifications.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"e4d2a649-362f-486c-872e-50f56b1ebbed","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:10:53.778Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7dc9ebac-2cb7-4327-8296-9a02cd3f7774","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"01abe44c-85f6-493a-927f-569987bde48b","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408","agentId":"a9d8ba25a087fb653","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T5SiYZ2VqKAEVqkcyB8Esh","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Arknights Endfield base building common mistakes pitfalls beginners\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield Beginner Guide — Day One Checklist, Build Tips, and Common Mistakes | Output Lag\",\"url\":\"https://outputlag.com/guides/arknights-endfield-beginner-guide-day-one-checklist-build-tips-and-common-mistakes/\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield - Base Building & Automation Mechanics - Mobalytics\",\"url\":\"https://mobalytics.gg/arknights-endfield/bases\"},{\"title\":\"How to Build Your First Base in Arknights: Endfield - Icy Veins\",\"url\":\"https://www.icy-veins.com/arknights-endfield/news/how-to-build-your-first-base-in-arknights-endfield/\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights Endfield Base Building Guide | Arknights: Endfield\",\"url\":\"https://endfield.gg/arknights-endfield-base-building-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"Endfield - A Guide for the Base From Start to Endgame\",\"url\":\"https://lungmendragons.com/guides/endfield/base-guide\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights Endfield AIC Base-Building Beginner’s Guide – Layouts and Early Upgrades\",\"url\":\"https://ultimategacha.com/arknights-endfield-aic-base-building-beginners-guide-layouts-early-upgrades/\"},{\"title\":\"AIC Factory and Base Building Guide | Arknights: Endfield\",\"url\":\"https://game8.co/games/Arknights-Endfield/archives/537154\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield Base Building Guide\",\"url\":\"https://www.mumuplayer.com/blog/arknights-endfield-base-building-guide.html\"},{\"title\":\"Early Game Factory Layout and Best Items Guide (Valley IV) | Arknights: Endfield｜Game8\",\"url\":\"https://game8.co/games/Arknights-Endfield/archives/575846\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights Endfield Building Guide (2026) - Complete Base Construction Tips | Arknights Endfield - Database, Tier List & Guides\",\"url\":\"https://www.endfield.info/guides/building\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here are the common mistakes and pitfalls for beginners in Arknights Endfield base building:\n\n## Key Common Mistakes:\n\n**Factory Layout & Building:**\nOverbuilding too early with sprawling belts and too many low-tier machines wastes power and materials; staying compact until Tier II is recommended. Badly placed Relay Towers or pylons lead to \"dead\" sections where facilities aren't powered.\n\n**Resource Production:**\nProducing everything at once by running every recipe clogs depots; instead pick a few priority products like construction materials and basic gear resources.\n\n**Neglecting AIC Upgrades:**\nLeaving Resourcing and Processing upgrades low makes later gear and material bottlenecks much worse.\n\n**General Approach Mistakes:**\nTreating factory automation as \"nice to have\" rather than foundational is a common mistake. Hoarding sanity \"just in case\" is problematic since there's no reason to save it—spending it daily prevents efficiency loss.\n\n## What Beginners Should Do Instead:\n\nBeginners should focus on a compact loop around the PAC, basic mining→smelting→crafting chains, and early AIC Plan upgrades in Resourcing, Logistics, Processing, and Power. Start small with basic setups in tiers I and II without stressing optimization; as you unlock more areas, you'll naturally expand your base and figure out what works best.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"e1ccc41c-8116-4eda-910c-c2bafedd34c6","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:10:56.062Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"01abe44c-85f6-493a-927f-569987bde48b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"75db0094-e1eb-4257-8e22-d2a3e0a5862f","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408","agentId":"a9d8ba25a087fb653","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CfxyzLafP1XgkLx1dcJrp6","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"终末地 基建 必避坑 错误 玩家 经验\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"终末地,今日公测!刚开服要做什么?要避雷什么?带你速通新手期!|明日方舟：终末地|明日方舟|角色扮演游戏|鹅|基建_新浪新闻\",\"url\":\"https://cj.sina.com.cn/articles/view/7857201856/1d45362c001901k82m?froms=ggmp\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟终末地》基建基础教学 自动生产线搭建原理说明-游民星空 GamerSky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202601/2079616.shtml\"},{\"title\":\"明日方舟：终末地基建玩法怎么摆攻略 谷地分基地答疑- 切游网\",\"url\":\"https://www.qieyou.com/content/152837\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟终末地》剧情开荒与基建心得 实用蓝图分享-游民星空 GamerSky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202601/2081116.shtml\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟终末地》工业开荒规划与产线布局分享-游民星空 GamerSky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202601/2080424.shtml\"},{\"title\":\"《终末地》20小时体验：基建纯噱头，UX像坐牢，但我居然玩下去了？ - 知乎\",\"url\":\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1998929160018630164\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟终末地》新手基础游玩指南 明日方舟终末地怎么玩_集成工业系统-游民星空 GamerSky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202601/2079685_6.shtml\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟：终末地》工厂玩法为什么这么上头？ - 知乎\",\"url\":\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/1997625176507060639\"},{\"title\":\"【终末地】基建毕业蓝图攻略！一个视频看懂四号谷地+武陵毕业！ |魔法Zc目录\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1s76FBGEow/\"},{\"title\":\"【终末地】全流程基建一键毕业！摆完挂机蓝图_攻略\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1abz6BAEz5/\"}]\n\n根据搜索结果，我为您整理了关于《明日方舟：终末地》基建玩法中需要避免的常见错误和玩家经验：\n\n## 基建开荒中的关键避坑\n\n**1. 推进主线的同时要推动基建发展**\n\n开服不要光推任务剧情，记得推动基建玩法，因为基建是获取角色养成材料、跑图所需设施和战斗所需大炮的重要来源。\n\n**2. 主线推进速度很关键**\n\n关键的等级节点是20、34、43，分别解锁蓝矿、砂叶、武陵（80级突破资源），晚一天解锁会就会少1-3个产出。不要纠结于全收集或管道美观，这些资源都放在图里不会少，不要在前期浪费宝贵的时间。\n\n**3. 优先级规划**\n\n在34级前，地区券的使用较为紧张，尽量不要升级无用的装置，优先升级主基地仓储线与扩建、副基地仓储线与扩建、物资调度终端和仓储节点。\n\n**4. 生产线优化**\n\n稳定产出当前等级的装备原件，解锁药品产线之后，稳定产出当前所需的药品。所有过渡的产物（如低级装备材料和炸药等物品）拉出简易产线获取一定量后应立刻转移生产避免浪费。\n\n**5. 不要过度计划早期支线任务**\n\n虽然支线玩法有一些有用材料，但在开服需要肝的前提下，最好是量力而行。\n\n这些建议主要针对想要高效推进游戏的玩家。合理规划好这些方面能帮助您快速上手终末地的基建系统。\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"63dece39-d65a-482a-9be5-405cfeb930b4","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:10:57.551Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"75db0094-e1eb-4257-8e22-d2a3e0a5862f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
